<title>USA: Des Plaines, Ill., $3 mln won by Harris Trust.</title>
<headline>Des Plaines, Ill., $3 mln won by Harris Trust.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Harris Trust &amp; Savings Bank said it won $3 million of Des Plaines, Ill., general obligation corporate purpose bonds, Series 1997 B, with a net interest cost of 5.063 percent.</p>
</text>
